nerated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:55.47,Title,,0,0,0,,The Legend of the MermaidDialogue: 1,0:01:49.96,0:01:55.47,Title,,0,0,0,,The Legend of the MermaidDialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:55.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm deflating!Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:12.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did they fire at their own battleship? Are they stupid?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've shrunk again.Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The idea of Gear Third seems so amazing and powerful,Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but my body's reaction is awkward.Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I stayed inflated for about a minute,Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:25.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I'll probably remain this size for another minute.Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:29.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd better hide until I return to normal, or I'll be killed!Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if he's serious or not,Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he's still alive.Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it would've been a shame if he had died in that shelling.Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's the island gate-waina!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're almost there-waina!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:26.06,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Your dear Franky has been taken away just like Tom-san was.Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.52,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna come along?Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat was raising hell on that battleship just a moment ago,Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:50.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but now he's been blown to smithereens!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Serves you right! Your captain is dead!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:58.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey now, they fired at the ship while their own men were on it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:02.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the power of a buster call, the attack I set in motion!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is justice, Cutty Flam!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:08.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, hand Nico Robin over to us.Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.77,0:04:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In return, I could make your charges go away.Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:17.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to protect that woman in the first place?Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not even a pirate.Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:24.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you'd trust that wicked woman— the kin of those Ohara devils—Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:28.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,over the World Government that protects  you peasants every day?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you defy us like Tom did, you'll end up just like h-Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M-My face can't get any more swollen!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He drew the elephant sword, Funkfreed!Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That thing is powerful!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, Funkfreed. We'll ensure they can't resist any longer...Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:59.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,by fatally wounding Nico Robin while her guard is down.Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elephant Chop!Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He stopped it!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless through and through.Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Funkfreed! You're an elephant! You shouldn't be losing to him!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Break free and cut them to shreds!Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:45.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Change your nose back to normal, elephant,Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,unless you want a bullet right between the eyes.Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:53.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right. That's good. You're smart.Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:57.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, will Straw Hat and the others come here?Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They all will. I'm sure.Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you that I'm betting everything on them, Spanda.Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:07.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:11.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd see the day.Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:16.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I could have done anything back then...Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:18.73,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I'm changing the charges.Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:23.69,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,For the crime of building a pirate ship for Pirate King Gold Roger,Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:27.65,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,the shipwright Tom will be escorted to Enies Lobby.Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:29.24,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,That is all.Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:35.58,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What got into that old geezer?Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:38.25,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. I don't have business with his apprentices.Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:40.67,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Release those two!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:49.43,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Tom-san can't be saved now.Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:53.60,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do against the World Government.Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:58.23,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Hang in there. Tom-san saved you two!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:00.10,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Make an enemy of the World Government,Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:02.48,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,and your days will be numbered!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:06.86,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby is the government's Judicial Island.Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.95,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,No criminals taken there...Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:12.37,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,have ever returned!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:16.79,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Is he mental?Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:17.75,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What should we do?Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.33,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Are you mental, too?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:25.13,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Just keep going; give him what he wants. It's none of our concern!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.30,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:31.30,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Stop, Puffing Tom!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:38.27,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking your creator?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:50.24,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:54.28,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I won't let you pass!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.83,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Give Tom-san back!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:08.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted to take back Tom-san at any cost.Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows the myth of the impregnable Enies Lobby.Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows the power of the World Government.Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At every turn, the Straw Hats upend what we all know.Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To rescue a friend,Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not one of them hesitates to declare war on the whole world.Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:37.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's exhilarating.Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To this very day, I've never forgotten Tom-san's death.Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The stupid face of that official...Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every time I thought of it,Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.97,0:08:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hoped that...Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:58.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it, you idiot! Stop it! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:02.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,one day I'd be able to crush him!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like that.Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to them, my wish came true.Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:38.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've already died once before.Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to sacrifice myself to get the Straw Hats outta here alive!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, hand over that escort ship!Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:57.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll prepare their escape route!Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll fight, too. I'm okay now.Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:22.81,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Run with all your might!Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:27.73,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,You'll die if you stay on the island! Sail out on my raft!Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:28.44,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,And you, Saul?Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:32.86,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,This is it for me. He got me.Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.69,0:10:34.28,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:37.05,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I don't want to! I'd be alone at sea!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:40.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is different from back on Ohara.Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:42.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to fear;Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:47.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.09,0:10:58.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-He found me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've sure got some unbalanced combat skills.Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:04.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You oughta embrace that.Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's the price you pay for the power you used earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vital Response: Paper Art Fighting Form.Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:18.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:30.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, your ridiculous attacks wouldn't...Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I'm stuck!Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:44.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:52.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a shame, but you're gonna die in that goofy form, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol: Spots!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:12:01.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go back to normal, body! Hurry! Hurry! I'm gonna be killed!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:17.67,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The damage I took earlier is affecting my legs!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:20.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? My body's coming back! I'm returning to normal!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See? My attacks...Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:38.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,did do a number on you.Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there anything we can do?Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:13:02.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to do something! We'll all drown!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.21,0:13:05.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We still haven't even gotten Robin-chan back yet!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:10.39,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this it? My life...Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:13.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,was quite fun.Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:16.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I haven't lived long enough!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:21.45,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, Usopp, proud warrior of the sea, shouldn't end up drowning!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:25.61,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't hold my breath any longer!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:31.16,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe! Everything's going dark!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:33.04,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:39.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine. Stay with me. I won't let you die!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.92,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:46.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's pulling me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:01.48,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, am I dreaming?Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.19,0:14:03.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I must be!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:08.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Several sailors are drowning at sea.Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:12.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,An elegant tail fin appears in their fading consciousness.Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:18.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,They look up and see long hair flowing in the water.Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:21.88,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,She's lovely.Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:26.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The legend of the mermaid appears as a vision.Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:33.31,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I'm dreaming, I don't want to...Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.14,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,wake up!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.51,0:14:41.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're taking the express! Now hold your breath, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:42.90,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It's...Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:46.82,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,– It's... – It's...Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:49.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It's... a dugong?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:15.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, marines! We're gonna use this ship to escape.Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:25.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we're done cleaning up the escort ship, or should I say, our exit strategy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.27,0:15:26.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we have to do now is wait for Straw Hat and the others.Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't...Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,die!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The main gate to Enies Lobby is just ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:14.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, giants!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:22.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can leave the island-waina!Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can escape-waina!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There, we did it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:33.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you impressed with the guts of us giants?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.44,0:16:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three battleships!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They beat us here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! They actually made it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:55.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we left them tied up in the courthouse!Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did they escape?Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:16:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.49,0:17:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.12,0:17:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Secure the targets. – Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:05.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,State your unit, department, and marine code,Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,show your ID badge, and get aboard this ship!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. Go ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:13.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a relief. I thought we were gonna go down with the island.Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:29.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Resistance is futile, pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.19,0:17:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make one move, and we'll open fire.Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:37.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sure doesn't seem like they're gonna let us go.Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.82,0:17:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The harbor and the fiery island are behind us.Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no place to escape-waina.Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.95,0:17:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guns and cannons are in front of us.Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you thinking about right now, Paulie?Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Memories of my life.Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:56.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not a good sign.Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:17:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And?Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:02.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell that lies before us.Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:12.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've recovered the marines and officials.Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All ships, stand clear of the main gate.Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.19,0:18:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're they gonna do?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Battleships 6, 7, and 8 identified pirates in front of the main gate.Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! Wake up!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:43.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.23,0:18:58.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle.Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How weird. They must've experienced a terrible shock.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They all stopped breathing, so they didn't swallow much water.Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:13.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good thing they're all okay. That said,Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:20.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what in the world is shocking enough to make them stop breathing?Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:22.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was you.Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:25.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:32.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be the friend that pirate king kid came to rescue.Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw you at Shift Station, right? I remember.Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back then,Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never thought you guys would pull something like this.Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put some clothes on, you damn hag!Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:53.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I laughed when I heard him say he was gonna be king of the pirates,Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:55.96,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Our friends are waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:58.13,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Don't stand in our way!Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:01.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but who knows? It might actually happen.Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.56,0:20:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is Nami-san okay?Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.19,0:20:18.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are as hardy as ever.Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:20.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're alive!Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.45,0:20:27.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! It was real! Mermaids don't exist!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:31.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the tales were true about people seeing a mermaid...Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:32.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then realizing it was just a dugong!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:36.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You morons! She still hasn't said she's a mermaid!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:37.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on the dream yet!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:41.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm an icefish mermaid.Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:43.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Don't say "icefish"!Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I've never heard of a mermaid with legs.Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have an objection, too!Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mermaids should be more...Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:21:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When mermaids are around 30, our tail fins split in two,Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:06.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we become able to live on land. We're a mysterious species.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you go to Fishman Island someday, you'll see.Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? They split in two? Oh, I see!Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:15.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say when a cat lives 100 years, its tail splits in two, and it becomes a monster.Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, a feline abomination, huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't lump me in with monsters!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:25.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you at least say thank you for what I did?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:29.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Kokoro-san!Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:31.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem.Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:56.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chwaaan!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:21:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where am I?Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:02.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.75,0:22:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we made it in time, Robin! You're safe!Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.01,0:22:08.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.34,0:22:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, all thanks to you guys.Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.02,0:22:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! That's amazing! So you were a mermaid all this time?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you were different since you have fins and scales!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.28,0:22:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay attention! You're her grandkid!Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:33.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.24,0:22:35.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:36.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:40.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't move my body.Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised. We'll tell you what  happened when this is all over.Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.78,0:23:11.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro! I mean, Zoro-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.03,0:23:14.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that.Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that's the island we were on until just a bit ago.Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.55,0:23:32.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with this attack? It's already a sea of flames!Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard that their orders are not to kill Nico Robin with the shelling.Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.27,0:23:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's why they're not targeting this bridge?Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.03,0:23:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trying not to kill her must mean they still intend to get her back.Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once they're through with Enies Lobby,Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.74,0:23:59.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they'll probably come after us to recapture Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, isn't that bad? We're all already battered and bruised, Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.08,0:24:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and there's a ton of crazy powerful  guys on those battleships, right?Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:08.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy right now?Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.13,0:24:13.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dust from their fighting still rises from the top of this bridge's first pillar.Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.89,0:24:26.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His opponent is, naturally, that pigeon guy, Rob Lucci.Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.90,0:24:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not far from here! If we give him a hand...Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.98,0:24:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.19,0:24:33.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pigeon guy is no ordinary man.Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.16,0:24:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't want to get dragged into the fight and get separated again.Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.04,0:24:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to make sure we still have an escape route...Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.67,0:24:51.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,whenever that line of battleships turns this way.Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for Luffy right here.Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.55,0:24:55.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all we need to do.Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.02,0:25:09.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The storm is just beginning.Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.19,0:25:12.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood.Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.37,0:25:27.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, your men...Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.13,0:25:34.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid! They've got the luck of the devil!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.63,0:25:36.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're fine. I'm sure they've gotten away safely!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.43,0:25:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Paulie! Come back!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.19,0:25:50.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you gonna do with that transponder snail?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.36,0:25:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find out how the Straw Hats are doing!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.15,0:25:59.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! It's cannon fire!Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.37,0:26:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.36,0:26:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the last time!Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.15,0:26:36.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't stop until I take you down.Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.53,0:26:38.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna exhaust yourself and die?Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.41,0:26:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know the future.Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.37,0:26:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear Second!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.33,0:26:52.42,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, ItsKipz, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cross this endless sea with me and search for Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,a global miracle no oneDialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,has yet been able to findDialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,With our hearts pounding,Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll just charge ahead as we please, following Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the footprints of those who pursue their dreams Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No matter how stormy the night,Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,if we put our minds together, Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll get through it Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,alwaysDialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Even though there are tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we don't want anyone to seeDialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the compass that leads to our dreams Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,always points straight ahead Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can't stop hereDialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get running,Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,head past everyone elseDialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So long as we don't run from it,Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we can take hold of tomorrow Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,everything we see in the moment,Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we should record it all Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,in the blank slates of our minds Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:41.62,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 2,0:00:00.38,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 2,0:00:00.42,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 2,0:00:00.45,0:00:01.83,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.49,0:00:01.83,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 3,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.48